 "strings": {
  "1. Simple Road": "",
  "A standard oval circuit. Stick close to the curves to lower your overall race time.": "",
  "2. Wide Way": "",
  "This wide-open course is great for building up speed and zipping through at high velocity.": "",
  "3. Northern Canyon": "",
  "A course that cuts through the Millennium Tower on the north side of town. Prepare for steep climbs and sharp drops.": "",
  "4. Breakthrough Cafe": "",
  "A course that starts in Little Asia and ends in M Side Cafe. Make sure you know when to brake, as the pathways get tricky toward the end.": "",
  "5. Pipeline": "",
  "A grueling course full of long, narrow paths. Avoiding obstacles is key to survival.": "",
  "6. Simple Road (Reverse)": "",
  "The reversed version of Simple Road. Make sure to hit all the Boost Points to build up to maximum speed.": "",
  "7. Wide Way (Reverse)": "",
  "The reversed version of Wide Way. The roads are wide open and the course is mostly straight, so your machine's overall speed is the most important aspect here.": "",
  "8. Northern Canyon (Reverse)": "",
  "The reversed version of Northern Canyon. Swerving in and out of Millennium Tower will be your biggest challenge here.": "",
  "9. Breakthrough Cafe (Reverse)": "",
  "The reversed version of Breakthrough Cafe. Features many narrow passages that are difficult to navigate, even for experienced racers.": "",
  "10. Pipeline (Reverse)": "",
  "A no-mercy, no Boost Points reversal of Pipeline. This brutal course takes every ounce of skill the racer has in order to reach the finish line.": "",
